# The ONE fresh-boot test admin. Every harness that boots an EMPTY instance
# and claims first-admin via signup sources this file — sprig-lifecycle.sh,
# manual-check.sh, run-cypress.sh (which forwards it to Cypress as
# CYPRESS_ADMIN_*; app/cypress/support/e2e.ts carries the same values as its
# documented fallback).
#
# The snapshot-backed gates (upgrade-gate.sh, surface-budget) are NOT
# consumers, on purpose: they inject a throwaway row into a COPY of production
# data, where this shared identity could collide with a real account and where
# a distinct name (upgrade-gate@sage.is) self-attributes as gate debris.
# Do not "DRY" them into this file.
TEST_ADMIN_NAME="Admin User"
TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL="admin@example.com"
TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD="password"
